    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Discover a simpler, more fulfilling life at Pebble Cove, the newest chapter in the prestigious St. Marnock's Bay development by Evara.\r\n\r\nNestled in Portmarnock—a welcoming, community-oriented suburb deeply rooted in maritime heritage and centred around the iconic Velvet Strand—this calm and inviting area makes everyday living effortlessly enjoyable. Whether you're strolling along miles of golden sands, swimming in the sea, dining out with friends, raising a family, or embracing any stage of life, this location has it all.\r\n\r\nResidents benefit from exceptional convenience, with local shops, highly regarded schools, and excellent transport links right on your doorstep. World-class golf clubs, expansive sandy beaches, and a variety of sporting facilities are just moments away.\r\n\r\nFurther afield, the charming villages of Malahide, Howth, and Sutton offer even more dining, leisure, and cultural options. Dublin City Centre is only 30 minutes away via the quick and reliable DART rail service, while proximity to the M1, M50, and Dublin Airport ensures seamless connectivity—making commutes, travel, and daily errands that much easier.\r\n\r\nEnjoy coastal living at its finest—welcome home to Pebble Cove."
      },
